height":334,"thumbnail":552,"small":553,"medium":554,"responsiveImage":555,"video":7},"HDyJZzHIRlOXFhteSdf-Wg","Bright orange @ครูตุลย์เล่าฟิสิกส์ brand lockup shown on a solid background.",{"x":47,"y":47},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=600&q=85&w=600","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1000&q=85&w=1000","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1500&q=85&w=1500",{"srcSet":556,"webpSrcSet":55,"sizes":340,"src":557,"width":342,"height":343,"aspectRatio":344,"alt":550,"title":7,"base64":558,"bgColor":559},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 610w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1220w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1830w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 2440w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760108286-group-2439.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440","data:image/png;base64,","#ff6700",{"id":561,"alt":7,"title":7,"focalPoint":7,"width":217,"height":217,"thumbnail":562,"small":563,"medium":564,"responsiveImage":7,"video":565},"CHCwdpJlTZuk7UaMKh1wHw","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760114492-tinyfish.mp4?auto=format&fit=max&h=600&q=85&w=600","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760114492-tinyfish.mp4?auto=format&fit=max&h=1000&q=85&w=1000","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760114492-tinyfish.mp4?auto=format&fit=max&h=1500&q=85&w=1500",{"mp4low":566,"mp4medium":567,"mp4high":568,"width":217,"height":217,"thumbnailUrl":569,"title":7,"duration":238},"https://stream.mux.com/IylgySf00i66sc7Uv687yfc2NTAuD8pt00/low.mp4","https://stream.mux.com/IylgySf00i66sc7Uv687yfc2NTAuD8pt00/medium.mp4","https://stream.mux.com/IylgySf00i66sc7Uv687yfc2NTAuD8pt00/high.mp4","https://image.mux.com/IylgySf00i66sc7Uv687yfc2NTAuD8pt00/thumbnail.jpg","\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp data-testid=\"Heading\" class=\"text-module__text__0GDob text-module__dark-grey__UFC18 text-module__medium__2Rl30 text-module__heading_article__2yUro heading-module__base__p-zaD heading-module__heading_article__h3IXH headline-module__headline__L8lWb\">@ครูตุลย์เล่าฟิสิกส์ raises $47 million in ICONIQ-led round.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>The Challenge We Tackled Together\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">@ครูตุลย์เล่าฟิสิกส์ had an impressive product already built&mdash;AI agents that intelligently automate web tasks for major companies&mdash;but they had no brand to match the tech. @ครูตุลย์เล่าฟิสิกส์ operate in the cutting-edge world of the agentic web, where AI learns and executes complex tasks, like competitive price tracking and product research, but their visual identity didn't tell that story. The challenge? Creating a brand from scratch that could make advanced AI feel approachable and memorable, while capturing the intelligent, methodical nature of what their technology actually does.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>How We Made It Happen\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We developed a complete visual system with unexpected tones and colors, designed multiple facial expressions to show personality, and created a motion brand that brought the character to life. The centerpiece was creating their character&mdash;a thoughtful, methodical tiny fish that became the face of their technology. We explored different applications from signage to apparel, developed comprehensive brand guidelines, and introduced the concept of \"the shoal\"&mdash;because tiny fish are stronger together, just like their AI agents working in concert.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>What We Achieved Together\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We gave @ครูตุลย์เล่าฟิสิกส์ a brand identity that makes complex AI technology feel human and approachable. The tiny fish character is instantly recognizable, and the complete visual system&mdash;from colors to motion to messaging&mdash;gave them everything needed to stand out in a crowded AI space. The timing couldn't have been better: after the brand launch, @ครูตุลย์เล่าฟิสิกส์ raised $47 million in their seed round. The new brand is smart and distinctive as the tech they're building, turning what could be an illusive tech concept into something people actually want to engage with.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","2025",[573,576,579,582,585,588,591],{"id":292,"slug":293,"title":294,"categories":574},[575],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":284,"slug":285,"title":286,"categories":577},[578],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":308,"slug":309,"title":310,"categories":580},[581],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":524,"slug":525,"title":526,"categories":583},[584],{"id":435,"slug":436,"title":437},{"id":540,"slug":541,"title":542,"categories":586},[587],{"id":435,"slug":436,"title":437},{"id":320,"slug":321,"title":322,"categories":589},[590],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":312,"slug":313,"title":314,"categories":592},[593],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},[595,599],{"id":596,"slug":597,"title":598},"ZdmR1ZiqRwqdcc81cJjaDg","a-i","Identity",{"id":600,"slug":601,"title":602},"HiI20E0UT2uB4YH7n9mRWg","saas","สายความรู้",[604,610,618,619,627,632,636,642,646,650,657,662,666,670,679,683,687],{"id":605,"type":606,"items":607},"Wqu5bU_3SIiVYm4-rRg1kw","media_custom_block",[608,609],{"media":7},{"media":7},{"id":611,"type":612,"media":613},"aCVNC1WFTZCe_oWNNqqw5Q","media_cols_block",[614],{"src":615,"video":616},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/1607