=85&w=800",{"id":671,"type":606,"items":672},"Xpym9GqGRgaeSB0EWLu6dg",[673,678],{"media":674},{"src":675,"video":676},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760106946-tf_1080_color_2.mp4?auto=format&fit=max&h=800&q=85&w=800",{"duration":677},3,{"media":7},{"id":680,"type":629,"media":681},"K3fIztdpQBGO-T54zGbq5w",{"src":682,"video":7},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760106946-group-5075.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=800&q=85&w=800",{"id":684,"type":629,"media":685},"I-cevBuNRM6qYyXwVur2Mw",{"src":686,"video":7},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760106943-group-5076.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=800&q=85&w=800",{"id":688,"type":606,"items":689},"agb4m5L3S_ObMSya0Hr8Wg",[690,691],{"media":7},{"media":7},{"id":693,"slug":694,"title":695,"media":696,"thumbnail":7,"about":698,"url":699,"year":571,"services":700,"industries":728,"blocks":738},"WKDC_VqTRxicx1okbcSYug","upshop","@ครัวหลังบ้าน",{"id":469,"alt":7,"title":7,"focalPoint":7,"width":217,"height":217,"thumbnail":470,"small":471,"medium":472,"responsiveImage":7,"video":697},{"mp4low":474,"mp4medium":475,"mp4high":476,"width":217,"height":217,"thumbnailUrl":477,"title":7,"duration":369},"\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>Through thick and thin, they are @ครัวหลังบ้าน's go-to for brand + digital.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>The Challenge We Tackled Together\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"837\">We&rsquo;ve been @ครัวหลังบ้าน&rsquo;s creative partners since the very beginning&mdash;building their first brand, watching them grow, and celebrating every milestone along the way. But here&rsquo;s the thing about success: it changes what you need. As @ครัวหลังบ้าน evolved into the dynamic force they are today, their original identity started feeling too small for their big ambitions. They came to us with exciting momentum and a clear vision: they needed their brand to evolve alongside their growth. The challenge? Taking the solid foundation we&rsquo;d created together years ago and transforming it into something sharper, bolder, and more dynamic&mdash;without losing the authentic spirit that got them here.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1218\">At the heart of that evolution is @ครัวหลังบ้าน 360, a powerful platform that unifies supply, demand, production, markdowns, and fulfillment into one intelligent system. It optimizes every aspect of store operations&mdash;from distribution center to doorstep&mdash;giving retailers the clarity, control, and agility they need to deliver smarter, faster, and more efficiently than ever before.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>How We Made It Happen\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>We weren&rsquo;t starting from scratch; we were building on a relationship and a brand we knew inside and out. Our approach touched everything: strategy sessions that redefined how @ครัวหลังบ้าน speaks to the world, branding that captures their vibrant confidence, and development work that makes every interaction feel effortless. As their business evolved, they needed a new site that could do more than just tell their story&mdash;it had to redefine their expanding offerings and spotlight their powerful 360 solutions. We reimagined typography, crafted motion that brings their story to life, and created a digital experience that moves as fast as their business does. Every choice was made to amplify what makes @ครัวหลังบ้าน special while setting them up for the exciting chapters ahead.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>What We Achieved Together\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>The new brand clarifies their messaging, simplifies how people navigate their world, and builds stronger connections between @ครัวหลังบ้าน and their audience. The website now tells a richer visual story&mdash;one that bridges the power of the @ครัวหลังบ้าน 360 platform with the customers who use it every day. Through purposeful design, motion, and storytelling, it shows how each part of the 360 ecosystem works together to simplify operations, empower teams, and elevate the customer experience. The result? A brand that&rsquo;s not just beautiful, but a powerful tool that drives engagement and strengthens @ครัวหลังบ้าน&rsquo;s mission.\u003C/p>","https://upshop.com/",[701,704,707,710,713,716,719,722,725],{"id":284,"slug":285,"title":286,"categories":702},[703],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":308,"slug":309,"title":310,"categories":705},[706],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":411,"slug":412,"title":413,"categories":708},[709],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":419,"slug":420,"title":421,"categories":711},[712],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":431,"slug":432,"title":433,"categories":714},[715],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":528,"slug":529,"title":530,"categories":717},[718],{"id":435,"slug":436,"title":437},{"id":540,"slug":541,"title":542,"categories":720},[721],{"id":435,"slug":436,"title":437},{"id":524,"slug":525,"title":526,"categories":723},[724],{"id":435,"slug":436,"title":437},{"id":304,"slug":305,"title":306,"categories":726},[727],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},[729,730,734],{"id":600,"slug":601,"title":602},{"id":731,"slug":732,"title":733},"G3pZPxAQSgmMnFEFUv9Rsw","food-and-retail","สายอาหาร",{"id":735,"slug":736,"title":737},"Cuq5aUDdR5ywug68wzgriw","b2b","Fandom Loop",[739,743,750,760,764,774,780,781,785,789,800,809,813,820,827,831],{"id":740,"type":629,"media":741},"EZ2j875iRu6HyA3gO_Bgvg",{"src":742,"video":7},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1757100391-macbook_air_08-3.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=800&q=85&w=800",{"id":744,"type":612,"media":745},"Jz9GXisvQBK_hBDp9Bn_qA",[746,748],{"src":747,"video":7},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760709939-group-5132.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=800&q=85&w=800",{"src":749,"video":7},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1760709939-group-5135.png?auto=format&fit=