datocms-assets.com/160733/1759502951-brainsave-3.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=1500&q=85&w=1500",{"srcSet":3379,"webpSrcSet":55,"sizes":340,"src":3380,"width":342,"height":3381,"aspectRatio":3382,"alt":3372,"title":7,"base64":3383,"bgColor":3384},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759502951-brainsave-3.jpg?auto=format&dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 610w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759502951-brainsave-3.jpg?auto=format&dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1220w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759502951-brainsave-3.jpg?auto=format&dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1830w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759502951-brainsave-3.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 2440w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759502951-brainsave-3.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440",1453,1.6791604197901049,"data:image/jpeg;base64,","#db9821","\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp class=\"alt\">\u003Cspan>Since the launch, we've successfully raised over $2 million in additional funding.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>The Challenge We Tackled Together\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">BrainSave had an idea. Envision an application that could capture every memory across all your digital touchpoints: voice diary entries, social media, photos, everything. The challenge? Taking this ambitious concept and turning it into something tangible enough to secure funding and get people excited about a product that didn't exist yet. They needed a brand, a story, and a way to show investors and early users what this memory-capturing experience could actually feel like.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>How We Made It Happen\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We built BrainSave's entire visual identity&mdash;branding, messaging, look and feel, and the application design itself. We created a fully immersive one-page site that tells the story of how memories get captured and compiled into a visual timeline. The trick was balancing tech-forward innovation with the warmth of personal storytelling, so we chose gold and amber tones paired with intimate photography and fluid animations that felt like memories unfolding. Every interaction was designed to give users that fleeting, precious feeling of a moment being preserved.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>What We Achieved Together\u003C/b>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We gave BrainSave everything they needed to turn their idea into reality. The brand identity captured the emotional weight of preserving life's moments, the application design showed exactly how the experience would work, and the website brought it all together in a way that made the concept feel real and exciting. The result? BrainSave secured $2 million in funding after launch. We helped them prove that their vision wasn't just possible&mdash;it was worth investing in.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","https://brainsave.ai/",[3388,3391,3394,3397,3400,3403,3406,3409,3412,3415,3418],{"id":292,"slug":293,"title":294,"categories":3389},[3390],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":284,"slug":285,"title":286,"categories":3392},[3393],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":308,"slug":309,"title":310,"categories":3395},[3396],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":411,"slug":412,"title":413,"categories":3398},[3399],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":419,"slug":420,"title":421,"categories":3401},[3402],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":431,"slug":432,"title":433,"categories":3404},[3405],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":423,"slug":424,"title":425,"categories":3407},[3408],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":536,"slug":537,"title":538,"categories":3410},[3411],{"id":435,"slug":436,"title":437},{"id":524,"slug":525,"title":526,"c