22-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=600&q=85&w=600","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759743322-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=1000&q=85&w=1000","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759743322-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=1500&q=85&w=1500",{"srcSet":4349,"webpSrcSet":55,"sizes":340,"src":4350,"width":342,"height":4351,"aspectRatio":4352,"alt":4343,"title":7,"base64":4353,"bgColor":4354},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759743322-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 610w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759743322-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1220w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759743322-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1830w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759743322-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 2440w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/160733/1759743322-shardeum-1.jpg?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440",1599,1.5258855585831064,"data:image/jpeg;base64,","#ff01a3","\u003Cblockquote>\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>The Challenge We Tackled Together\u003C/b>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shardeum came to us with something rare in the crypto space&mdash;a genuinely massive, engaged community and a strong brand foundation. But their website wasn't living up to the energy of their audience. They needed a digital home that could serve as a robust resource hub for their community, showcase their charity work and proof-of-community initiatives, and handle the enormous amount of content they were constantly producing. The challenge? Taking their existing brand essence&mdash;a logo and a passionate following&mdash;and building a complete visual system and website that could capture their community-first philosophy while staying credible in the serious world of blockchain technology.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>How We Made It Happen\u003C/b>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We built Shardeum's complete brand system&mdash;establishing colors, visual language, and a design approach rooted in their name's origin: sharding, the process that divides the blockchain. We created a visual identity where shards of the logo appear throughout the site, reinforcing the idea that everything's connected. We designed a navigation system that made their resources easy to explore and developed a super-robust blog with custom templates that could handle their content creation. The whole experience balances fun, approachable energy with the credibility blockchain companies need.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>\u003Cb>What We Achieved Together\u003C/b>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We gave Shardeum a digital presence that finally matches the scale of their community. The new brand system and website became the resource hub they needed, with a blog that's now packed with content they've seamlessly produced using our templates. The visual identity&mdash;built around shards and connection&mdash;perfectly captures their community-driven ethos while keeping things credible and polished. The numbers speak for themselves: their ecosystem continues to grow massively, and they now have a platform that can grow right alongside them. Shardeum took what we built and ran with it, proving that when you give a great community the right tools, they'll create something even bigger.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","https://shardeum.org/",[4358,4361,4364,4367,4370],{"id":411,"slug":412,"title":413,"categories":4359},[4360],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":419,"slug":420,"title":421,"categories":4362},[4363],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":431,"slug":432,"title":433,"categories":4365},[4366],{"id":324,"slug":325,"title":326},{"id":320,"slug":321,"title":322,"categories":4368},[4369],{"id":210,"slug":211,"title":212},{"id":532,"slug":533,"title":534,"categories":4371},[4372],{"id":435,"slug":436,"title":437},[4374],